cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these datasets in research, please cite this repository. ByKaranteli's own computations in these files are CC0; third-party values in them remain under their sources' terms."
title: "ByKaranteli Crypto Datasets"
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "ByKaranteli"
    website: "https://bykaranteli.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/bykarantelicom/crypto-datasets"
url: "https://bykaranteli.com/data"
license: CC0-1.0
abstract: >-
  Crypto market datasets (published daily 2026-07-23 to 2026-09-10, frozen since;
  live series continue at bykaranteli.com/data) recorded by ByKaranteli: multi-venue
  liquidation totals, CFTC COT positioning, Coinbase premium, options open interest
  and tape rollups, execution-cost ladders, venue market snapshots and a daily
  quantum-exposure measurement from ByKaranteli's own Bitcoin Core node. CC0 covers
  ByKaranteli's own computations; third-party values remain under their sources'
  terms. Quarterly frozen releases are tagged for reproducible citation.
keywords:
  - cryptocurrency
  - bitcoin
  - liquidations
  - derivatives
  - market-data
  - open-data
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.22049575
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.22049575
    description: Concept DOI, resolves to the latest frozen release
